# i18n audit — cache.json and report.md ARE committed (the cache doubles as the
# spend ledger). These two are not: a temp file from an interrupted write, and
# an intermediate artifact that gets hand-applied to phrasebook.ts.
scripts/i18n-audit/cache.json.tmp
scripts/i18n-audit/notes-pa.generated.json